# Every build and check in this repository runs on Linux (the container defined
# by container/Containerfile, and CI). CR breaks shebang lines, make's recipe
# parsing, yosys's script reader and `veryl fmt --check`, so the working tree
# keeps LF on Windows too, regardless of the user's core.autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Unified-diff context prefixes existing tabs and empty lines with a space.
container/openfpgaloader/*.patch whitespace=-blank-at-eol,-space-before-tab
